/P 56 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 56 0 R
/E (And if nations remember those who fought for their freedom, they must also remember those who had the courage to defend it, nurture it, and pass it on. For a history that forgets its women is a history that tells only half the story of its own courage.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
